       and fills in the rest of the fields in _u___i_n_f_o.

       sseett__tthhrreeaadd__aarreeaa() sets a TLS entry in the GDT.

       The TLS array entry set by sseett__tthhrreeaadd__aarreeaa() corresponds to  the  value
       of  _u___i_n_f_o_-_>_e_n_t_r_y___n_u_m_b_e_r  passed  in  by the user.  If this value is in
       bounds, sseett__tthhrreeaadd__aarreeaa() writes  the  TLS  descriptor  pointed  to  by
       _u___i_n_f_o into the thread’s TLS array.

