       a  free  TLS  entry.   If sseett__tthhrreeaadd__aarreeaa() finds a free TLS entry, the
       value of _u___i_n_f_o_-_>_e_n_t_r_y___n_u_m_b_e_r is set upon return to  show  which  entry
